<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Japan upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Japan upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Friday analyst Matt Aizawa had raised his rating for Amway Japan Ltd to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- He kept his rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company closed Thursday at 15-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
